---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Terms of Service - Finsiva" description="Finsiva terms of service outlining the terms and conditions for using our tax calculators and tools.">
  <div class="min-h-screen bg-canvas dark:bg-canvas">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-ink mb-8 dark:text-on-primary">Terms of Service</h1>
      <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-8KZTzcaiXWQ?w=1200&q=80" alt="Legal documents and contracts" class="mb-6 w-full rounded-lg object-cover max-h-80 sm:max-h-96" loading="lazy" />
      <div class="prose max-w-none space-y-6 text-body dark:text-muted">
        <p><strong>Last Updated:</strong> July 2026</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink dark:text-on-primary">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p>By accessing and using Finsiva ("the Service"), you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree to these terms, please do not use our services. These terms apply to all visitors, users, and others who access or use the Service, regardless of how they access it, whether through a desktop browser, mobile device, or embedded application.</p>
        <p>Your continued use of the Service following the posting of any changes to these terms constitutes acceptance of those changes. We encourage you to review this page periodically to stay informed of your rights and obligations.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink dark:text-on-primary">2. Service Description</h2>
        <p>Finsiva provides free, browser-based tax calculators, educational guides, and informational resources for various countries and tax types. Our tools are designed for estimation and informational purposes only. We cover income tax, sales tax, property tax, capital gains tax, payroll tax, and other common categories for a growing list of supported jurisdictions.</p>
        <p>The Service is intended for use by individuals, small business owners, freelancers, students, and anyone who needs a quick, reliable estimate of tax liability. It is not intended to replace professional tax preparation software or the advice of a qualified tax advisor.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink dark:text-on-primary">3. Disclaimer of Professional Advice</h2>
        <p>THE CALCULATORS AND CONTENT ON TAXPORTAL ARE PROVIDED "AS IS" WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND. Finsiva does not provide tax, legal, or financial advice. The results produced by our calculators are estimates and should not be relied upon as the sole basis for tax filing decisions. Always consult a qualified tax professional for advice specific to your situation.</p>
        <p>We explicitly disclaim any responsibility for tax penalties, interest, or additional liabilities that may arise from reliance on our calculators. Tax authorities may apply different definitions, rounding methods, or transitional rules than those used in our tools. Users are solely responsible for verifying results against official forms and guidance before submitting returns.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink dark:text-on-primary">4. Accuracy and Updates</h2>
        <p>We strive to keep our calculators and content updated with the latest tax laws and rates. However, we do not guarantee that all information is always current or error-free. Tax laws change frequently, and users are responsible for verifying the accuracy of tax rules before making financial decisions.</p>
        <p>When a tax authority announces a new rate or rule, we aim to update our calculators within a reasonable timeframe. However, there may be a delay between official publication and our implementation. During this period, users should consult the tax authority's official resources for the most current information.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink dark:text-on-primary">5. No Guarantee of Results</h2>
        <p>Finsiva makes no guarantee that the results from our calculators will match the tax liability calculated by any tax authority. Actual tax owed may differ based on individual circumstances, additional deductions, credits, or changes in tax law.</p>
        <p>Calculators are simplified models that cannot capture every nuance of tax legislation. Factors such as alternative minimum tax, phase-out thresholds, recapture rules, and residency tests may not be fully represented. Users with complex situations should seek professional advice.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink dark:text-on-primary">6. User Responsibility</h2>
        <p>You are solely responsible for ensuring the accuracy of the information you enter into our calculators and for the decisions you make based on the results provided. Finsiva is not liable for any losses, penalties, or damages arising from the use of our tools.</p>
        <p>You agree not to use our calculators for fraudulent purposes, including generating false financial statements, supporting tax evasion schemes, or misleading third parties. We reserve the right to restrict access for users who abuse the Service.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink dark:text-on-primary">7. Modifications to Service</h2>
        <p>We reserve the right to modify, suspend, or discontinue any part of the Service at any time, with or without notice. This includes adding or removing calculators, changing fee structures, altering site features, or discontinuing support for specific countries or tax types.</p>
        <p>We will make reasonable efforts to provide advance notice of significant changes that affect functionality, such as the removal of a popular calculator or a shift in data architecture. However, we cannot guarantee uninterrupted access or the permanent availability of any specific tool.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink dark:text-on-primary">8. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>To the fullest extent permitted by law, Finsiva shall not be liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, consequential, or special damages arising from the use of our services. This includes, but is not limited to, loss of profits, data, goodwill, or other intangible losses.</p>
        <p>Some jurisdictions do not allow the exclusion of certain warranties or the limitation of liability for consequential damages. In such jurisdictions, our liability shall be limited to the maximum extent permitted by applicable law.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink dark:text-on-primary">9. Governing Law</h2>
        <p>These Terms of Service shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the jurisdiction in which Finsiva operates, without regard to its conflict of law provisions. Any disputes arising under these terms shall be resolved in the courts of that jurisdiction.</p>
        <p>If you access the Service from outside the primary jurisdiction, you are responsible for compliance with local laws, including any tax reporting or data protection obligations that apply to your use of our tools.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink dark:text-on-primary">10. Dispute Resolution</h2>
        <p>We encourage users to contact us directly at support@finsiva.com to resolve any disputes arising from the use of our Service. We will work in good faith to address concerns within a reasonable timeframe.</p>
        <p>If a dispute cannot be resolved informally, it may be submitted to binding arbitration or the appropriate courts, depending on applicable law. You agree to waive any right to participate in class-action lawsuits or class-wide arbitration against Finsiva.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink dark:text-on-primary">11. Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p>All content, trademarks, logos, and software on Finsiva are the property of Finsiva or its licensors. You may not copy, modify, distribute, or exploit any content without express written permission. Unauthorized use may violate copyright, trademark, and other laws.</p>
        <p>You may print or save individual pages for personal, non-commercial use, provided that you retain all copyright and attribution notices. Systematic extraction of data or content for republishing on other sites is prohibited without prior written agreement.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink dark:text-on-primary">12. User Conduct</h2>
        <p>You agree to use Finsiva only for lawful purposes. You may not attempt to gain unauthorized access to our systems, interfere with site functionality, or use our calculators to generate fraudulent or misleading financial documents.</p>
        <p>Prohibited activities include scraping, data mining, or using automated scripts to extract content at scale. We employ monitoring systems to detect abuse and may block IP addresses or user agents that violate these terms.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink dark:text-on-primary">13. Termination</h2>
        <p>We reserve the right to suspend or terminate access to our services at any time, without notice, for conduct that we believe violates these Terms or is harmful to other users, us, or third parties.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink dark:text-on-primary">14. Changes to Terms</h2>
        <p>We reserve the right to modify these Terms of Service at any time. Changes will be effective immediately upon posting to this page.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink dark:text-on-primary">15. Contact</h2>
          <p>For questions about these Terms of Service, contact us at <a href="/contact" class="text-link hover:underline dark:text-link">support@finsiva.com</a> or visit our <a href="/about" class="text-link hover:underline dark:text-link">About</a> page.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>